# --- Agent tooling installed per machine -------------------------------------
#
# Skill bundles and their prebuilt engines are installed by each person for their
# own assistant, and the engines are darwin-arm64 Mach-O binaries: useless to CI
# or to anyone on another platform, and not something a repository should be
# distributing. Everyone runs the installer themselves; see the README.
graphify-out/
.agents/skills/impeccable/
.agents/skills/task-observer/
.agents/skills/framer-motion-*/
.github/skills/
.github/agents/
.github/hooks/
.codex/
